ho can be terrified of anything off of our laps was calmer there than in most places outside her domain.\nDavid P.\nThe most compassionate, skilled, wonderful doctors and staff. They know what they’re doing and they do it better than anyone. They saved my 14-year-old Poodle who was seriously ill and treated him like he was their own baby. Forever grateful!!\nCasey D.\nOutstanding care by a truly remarkable team of dedicated veterinary specialists. I was referred to AVS after my personal vet referred my pug, Gigi, to them. She had developed pancreatitis with secondary diabetes. Thank you AVS.\nChad H.\nAdvanced Veterinary Specialists\n414 East Carrillo Street\nSanta Barbara\n,\nCA\n93101\nT:\n(805) 729-4460\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nRequest an Appointment\nAbout Us\nView all Services\nSelf Service Portal\nBlog\nContact Us\n©\nCopyright\n2026\nCareers\nFAQ\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nCookie Preferences\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
